# Applies to `docker build` runs whose context is the repo root
# (currently: the @watts/bot image — `docker build -f apps/dbot/Dockerfile .`).
# Keeps the build context small and secrets out of the image.
#
# The whole workspace tree IS copied on purpose: `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile`
# validates every importer in pnpm-lock.yaml, so removing sibling workspaces here
# would break the install. `--filter @watts/bot...` limits what actually installs.

**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/build
**/.turbo

# secrets — never ship these; prod passes env through the container
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

.git
.github
**/*.log
**/coverage
**/.DS_Store
infra/certs/*
